[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "このへんで！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Over here!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "りょーかい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Got it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私たちはまず、島の外周を回って、アルビーナが作った\n匂い袋を撒きながら中心へと進んで行く",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "First, we'll circle the island's perimeter, spreading Alvina's scent pouches as we move toward the center."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もちろん、高音発生器を作動させておくことも忘れない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And of course, we'll keep the sonic emitter running."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ツォルンフルクが嫌う匂いと音。これでやつは\n島の中心部に追い詰められる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The scent and sound that Zornfluch hates. This will force it toward the center of the island."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "追い詰めたところを、私の銃で狙う。これで終わり",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Once it's cornered, I'll take the shot. That's all there is to it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "みんな、頑張ろうね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's do our best, everyone."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姉様、次はこっち――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina, this way next—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いたいたっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Found you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ひゃっ！\u3000ラ、ライザさん！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Eep! R-Ryza?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はぁっ、はぁっ！\u3000大変だよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*pant* *pant* This is bad!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "な、何かあったんですか！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "W-what happened?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今、ノーヴァ神聖国本土の周りから\n煙が上がってるんだって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There's smoke rising from all around Nova's mainland!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "煙！？\u3000火災でも起きているの！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Smoke!? Is there a fire?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それが、誰かがミンツェの花を燃やしてるらしいんだ。\n島中から焼き尽くそうって規模みたいで……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Someone's burning all the Minze flowers. Looks like they're trying to destroy every last one on the island..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これ、多分アイツの仕業だよ。\n操った人たちを使ってるんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This has to be their doing. They're using the people they've controlled."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ツォルンフルク……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zornfluch..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やつはノーヴァ神聖国へ戻ろうとしてるんだ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They're trying to get to Nova..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姉様！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうはさせない！\u3000急ごう！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We won't let them! Hurry!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]